<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700">Confirm your place on the waitlist</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Thanks for joining the {{ appName }} waitlist. Confirm your email address to secure your place and qualify for <b>one month of the Developer plan at no charge</b> when you create your account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px">
  <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#EB4747;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px">Confirm my email</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6a6a6a">This link expires in {{ expiryHours }} hours. If it stops working, just sign up again on {{ baseUrl }}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6a6a6a">The benefit requires no card, does not renew and moves to Free after the month ends.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6a6a6a">If you didn't sign up for the {{ appName }} waitlist, you can safely ignore this email — we won't contact you again.</p>
